.SH NAME
SystemEx.Drawing.ISubCanvas< T > \- Represents a mathematical sub‑canvas that participates as a layer within a layered canvas system\&. A sub‑canvas does not perform graphical drawing; instead, it defines deterministic transformation rules, visibility states, and optional masking that influence the final composed pixel buffer when requested through \fBICanvasList<T>\&.GetPixels\fP or \fBICanvasList<T>\&.SwapIn\fP\&.  

